{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<i>Switch Box</i>&quot; is a 2D pixel-art puzzle platformer. In an unfamiliar world, you must interact with the environment and utilize tools to solve challenges, overcome obstacles, and ultimately discover the path back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to forge ahead and clear the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282350/extras/item_2.gif?t=1745158694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the items around you to pass through obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282350/extras/item_1.gif?t=1745158694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seize the right moment to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282350/extras/2.gif?t=1745158694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flip the switch and proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282350/extras/3.gif?t=1745158694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expected, yet unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282350/extras/platform_3.gif?t=1745158694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge a path through peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282350/extras/platform_4.gif?t=1745158694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the goal to reach the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img clas